        <h1 class="entry-title">普庵祖師聖誕傳愛 前進校園獎助學子為地方祈福</h1>        <div class="post-meta-share-wrapper">
            <div class="post-meta-detail">
                                    <span class="min-read-post-format">
                                                                            </span>
                <span class="entry-meta">
                                        
      <span class="item-metadata posts-author byline">
        <i class="fa fa-pencil-square-o"></i>
                        <a href="https://www.baitimes.com/author/danieltarn1/">
                    danieltarn1                </a>
             </span>
                                    </span>
                      <span class="item-metadata posts-date">
        <i class="fa fa-clock-o"></i>
        2026 年 1 月 15 日      </span>
                                </div>
                    </div>

    </div>
                        </div>


                </div>

            </div>


            
        </header><!-- .entry-header -->

        <!-- end slider-section -->
        

    <div id="content" class="container-wrapper ">
    <div class="af-container-block-wrapper clearfix">
        <div id="primary" class="content-area ">
            <main id="main" class="site-main ">
                                    <article id="post-35051" class="post-35051 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-taiwan category-10 tag-9708 tag-10067 tag-7252 tag-10066 tag-10065">

                        
                                                        <div class="entry-content-wrap read-single">
                                    
                                    

        <div class="entry-content read-details">
            
<p>記者談曉泉／綜合報導</p>



<p>為慶祝普庵祖師菩薩聖誕，社團法人新竹縣普庵慈善協會於今日（15日）假新豐國中舉辦「勵志勤學獎」頒獎活動；本次活動不僅嘉惠新豐鄉內的三所國中總計63個班級的學子，更結合齋僧祈福與捐血活動，將宗教信仰轉化為社會公益的實際力量，為地方帶來祥和與溫暖。</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img decoding="async" width="1024" height="577" src="https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/361737-1024x577.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-35052" srcset="https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/361737-1024x577.jpg 1024w, https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/361737-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/361737-768x432.jpg 768w, https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/361737-1536x865.jpg 1536w, https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/361737.jpg 1705w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>



<p>結合文教與慈善，傳承祖師慈悲精神</p>



<p>普庵慈善協會理事長余冠宏表示，今日適逢普庵祖師聖誕，協會秉持祖師大慈大悲的精神，特別規劃文教公益活動，走入校園鼓勵勉勵學子勤奮向上。除了教育獎助，協會更邀請臺灣色拉傑雲登山寺與臺灣法身寺的出家僧眾來到新豐接受應供，並同步舉辦捐血活動，號召大眾捲起袖子分享愛心，以多元的善舉為祖師慶壽。</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img decoding="async" width="1024" height="577" src="https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/361955-1024x577.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-35053" srcset="https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/361955-1024x577.jpg 1024w, https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/361955-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/361955-768x432.jpg 768w, https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/361955-1536x865.jpg 1536w, https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/361955.jpg 1705w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>



<p>議長助理張以聖勉勵學子：傳遞溫暖，回饋社會</p>



<p>新竹縣議會議長張鎮榮助理張以聖今日也特別到場出席頒獎典禮，致詞深情勉勵在場學子，期許學生們能將這份來自社會的關心銘記於心，並將這股溫暖轉化為進步的動力。他表示：「希望大家在未來行有餘力時，也能播下善的種子，去幫助更多需要幫助的人，讓這份溫暖持續感染社會每一個角落。」</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="769" src="https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/361950-1024x769.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-35054" srcset="https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/361950-1024x769.jpg 1024w, https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/361950-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/361950-768x577.jpg 768w, https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/361950.jpg 1476w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>



<p>南傳藏傳圓融祈福，祈願地方平安祥和</p>



<p>活動當日亮點之一為隆重的齋僧與祈福儀式。活動圓滿後，由臺灣法身寺住持法深法師帶領南傳法師，依循南傳儀軌進行誦經祈福；隨後由臺灣色拉傑雲登山寺住持法寶格西帶領藏傳格西，依藏傳儀軌給予加持。</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="768" height="1024" src="https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/362019-768x1024.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-35055" srcset="https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/362019-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/362019-225x300.jpg 225w, https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/362019-1024x1365.jpg 1024w, https://www.baitimes.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/362019.jpg 1108w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" /></figure>



<p>現場氣氛莊嚴殊勝，透過不同傳承的宗教儀式，共同祈求新豐地區風調雨順、地方平安。新竹縣普庵慈善協會表示，未來將持續推動各類慈善事業，讓宗教的力量成為安定社會、淨化人心的一股清流。</p>
                            <div class="post-item-metadata entry-meta">
